*.kicad_sch-bak
# Exported netlists are a mechanical, fully-regenerable artifact of the checked-in
# schematic (one `kicad-cli sch export netlist` command) -- committing one risks it
# silently going stale if the schematic changes without a re-export, which would make
# hardware/gen/check_mule_netlist.py and hardware/gen/gen_mule_pcb.py's verification
# stronger than the committed evidence actually is (see task-2-report.md, task-3-report.md).
*.net
